# Bazel must not descend into the Sliceme campaign plane.
#
# Sliceme keeps one git worktree per DAG node under .sliceme/worktrees/<node>/,
# and each worktree is a full nested copy of this project with its own BUILD
# files and MODULE.bazel. Bazel does not read .gitignore, so without this file
# `bazel build //...` treats every nested copy as a package of this workspace
# and compiles it (failing on nested-relative includes). Ignore the plane.
.sliceme
